{"hw":"ἐπακολουθέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπακολουθέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπακολουθ-έω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">follow close upon, follow after, pursue,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τινί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1328</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23c</span> </span>, al.; <b class=\"lex-tr\">move with,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τῷ ἄλλῳ σώματι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fract.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">16</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. ἡ χεὶρ τοῦ νεκροῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3.8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">pursue</b> as an enemy, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.128</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.65</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">[4.1.1]</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">attend to, follow</b> mentally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">understand,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τῷ λόγῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">107b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖς λεγομένοις</span> <span cl